      "locked": false,
      "text": "Many courses taught at universities focus way too much on theory and not enough\non actually preparing you for interviews. Many students will take a university\nalgorithms course and still struggle to implement simple algorithms.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Many courses taught at universities focus way too much on theory and not enough on actually preparing you for interviews. Many students will take a university algorithms course and still struggle to implement simple algorithms.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "jcz5bxuKeRqXXN3oQrXOu",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3008.7451513253486,
      "y": 866.3313280865889,
      "width": 725.9991455078125,
      "height": 60,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aS",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1553411635,
      "version": 285,
      "versionNonce": 1975724821,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1763745652220,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Interview Focused: We focus on the practical implementation of DSA. Sure,\nimplementing a red-black tree from scratch is cool, but you would be better off\npracticing more common concepts.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Interview Focused: We focus on the practical implementation of DSA. Sure, implementing a red-black tree from scratch is cool, but you would be better off practicing more common concepts.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "LnW0hxF_q6jETYH8oL1xe",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3009.0478857003486,
      "y": 947.7067631521365,
      "width": 670.9990844726562,
      "height": 60,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aT",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2024232723,
      "version": 407,
      "versionNonce": 783745141,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1763745652220,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "TLDR: This course covers the majority of data structures & algorithms (DSA)\ntopics required to succeed in technical interviews. For more advanced\ntopics, please see the Advanced Algorithms course.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "TLDR: This course covers the majority of data structures & algorithms (DSA) topics required to succeed in technical interviews. For more advanced topics, please see the Advanced Algorithms course.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "VrA7OmdajFe3PKntOL6XB",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3012.7295263253486,
      "y": 1022.5309819021365,
      "width": 681.9990844726562,
      "height": 40,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aU",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1231787933,
      "version": 425,
      "versionNonce": 961096149,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1763745652220,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "In technical interviews, candidates are expected to code an efficient\nalgorithm, and comfortably discuss tradeoffs of that algorithm.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "In technical interviews, candidates are expected to code an efficient algorithm, and comfortably discuss tradeoffs of that algorithm.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "pKrMcrCOZPLBu8JaVugv9",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3019.3506200753486,
      "y": 1084.0251225271365,
      "width": 714.9990234375,
      "height": 60,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aV",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 108068019,
      "version": 413,
      "versionNonce": 1989093173,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1763745652220,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "It may not be fair, but being good at coding interviews can mean the difference\nbetween landing your first job or not. It can be a difference of tens or even\nhundreds of thousands of dollars in extra compensation.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "It may not be fair, but being good at coding interviews can mean the difference between landing your first job or not. It can be a difference of tens or even hundreds of thousands of dollars in extra compensation.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "4cMByhcz9e5GqLgw7ka3A",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3018.7060888253486,
      "y": 1166.7790287771365,
      "width": 703.9990844726562,
      "height": 40,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aW",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 313564157,
      "version": 427,
      "versionNonce": 149846165,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1763745652220,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Whether the time invested is worth it is up to you. This is just how the game\nis played today, for better or worse.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Whether the time invested is worth it is up to you. This is just how the game is played today, for better or worse.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
