      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1764005566892,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- NAB have good chance of placements, 11 got placed last year\n- its really good that i didn't get placed in HCL, because i deserve so much better\n- NAB = Natwest\n- i would be last person to become unplaced\nbecause other people just code for job\ni do for love, i do for projects instead of job, he saw my portfolio\nand in my portfolio, unlike others who do just template simple, i iterate and tasalli se banai hai\n- i am one of great coders in college\n- i deserve much better\n- in hcl, less salary growth even after 5years, \ni can grow to 20lpa+ next year in NAB",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- NAB have good chance of placements, 11 got placed last year\n- its really good that i didn't get placed in HCL, because i deserve so much better\n- NAB = Natwest\n- i would be last person to become unplaced\nbecause other people just code for job\ni do for love, i do for projects instead of job, he saw my portfolio\nand in my portfolio, unlike others who do just template simple, i iterate and tasalli se banai hai\n- i am one of great coders in college\n- i deserve much better\n- in hcl, less salary growth even after 5years, \ni can grow to 20lpa+ next year in NAB",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
