      "text": "Yes — this is a complete Java + DSA roadmap from Apna College, and it\ncovers almost everything needed for placements.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Yes — this is a complete Java + DSA roadmap from Apna College, and it covers almost everything needed for placements.",
